msgid "SMILES (Molecular integrals with Slater functions)"
msgstr "SMILES（使用斯莱特函数的分子积分）"

msgid ""
"SMILES is a package for molecular integrals with Slater functions "
"implemented by J. Fernandez Rico, R. Lopez, G. Ramirez, I. Ema, D. Zorrilla "
"and K.Ishida. It combines several techniques for the evaluation of the "
"different types of integrals, a summary of which can be found in J. "
"Fernandez Rico, R. Lopez, G. Ramirez, I. Ema, `J. Comput. Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/jcc.20131>`__ **25**, 1987-1994 (2004) and J. "
"Fernandez Rico, I. Ema, R. Lopez, G. Ramirez and K. Ishida, *SMILES: A "
"package for molecular calculations with STO* in Recent Advances in "
"Computational Chemistry. Molecular Integrals over Stater Orbitals, Telhat "
"Ozdogan and Maria Belen Ruiz eds., ISBN ..."
msgstr ""
"SMILES 是一个用于计算斯莱特函数分子积分的软件包，由 J. Fernandez Rico、R. Lopez、G. Ramirez、I. "
"Ema、D. Zorrilla 和 K. Ishida 实现。它结合了多种技术来评估不同类型的积分，其摘要可参见 J. Fernandez "
"Rico、R. Lopez、G. Ramirez、I. Ema 的 `J. Comput. Chem. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1002/jcc.20131>`__ **25**, 1987-1994 (2004) 以及 J. "
"Fernandez Rico、I. Ema、R. Lopez、G. Ramirez 和 K. Ishida 的 *SMILES: A package "
"for molecular calculations with STO*\\ ，收录于《Recent Advances in Computational"
" Chemistry. Molecular Integrals over Stater Orbitals》，Telhat Ozdogan 和 Maria"
" Belen Ruiz 编辑，ISBN …"

msgid ""
"The SMILES module is invoked by the ``intyp=’SLATER’`` card. Name for "
"ancillary files generated by the package can be supplied by ``SLFILES=`` "
"*filename*. Default name is ’slscratch’."
msgstr ""
"SMILES 模块通过 ``intyp=’SLATER’`` 卡片调用。该软件包生成的辅助文件名称可通过 ``SLFILES=`` *文件名* "
"指定。默认名称为 'slscratch'。"

msgid ""
"Three-center two-electron integrals of types :math:`(AB|AC)` and "
":math:`(AB|CD)` are computed by means of Gaussian expansions (STO-nG). The "
"default length of the expansions is 9 (STO-9G). However, integrals obtained "
"with STO-9G expansions may have not sufficient accuracy for post-HF "
"calculations, specially with high quality basis sets. In these cases, the "
"length of the expansions can be changed setting the variable ``NGSSTO=`` "
"*number of gaussians*. Though a maximum of ``NGSSTO=30`` is allowed, the "
"lengths of the expansions actually available in the package depend on the "
":math:`(n,l)` quantum numbers. If an expansion not included is required, the"
" program takes the largest currently available."
msgstr ""
"类型为 :math:`(AB|AC)` 和 :math:`(AB|CD)` 的三中心双电子积分通过高斯展开（STO-nG）计算。展开的默认长度为 "
"9（STO-9G）。然而，使用 STO-9G 展开获得的积分对于后 HF 计算（尤其是使用高质量基组时）可能精度不足。在这些情况下，可以通过设置变量 "
"``NGSSTO=`` *高斯函数数量* 来更改展开长度。虽然允许的最大值为 ``NGSSTO=30``\\ ，但软件包中实际可用的展开长度取决于 "
":math:`(n,l)` 量子数。如果需要未包含的展开，程序将采用当前可用的最大展开。"

msgid ""
"Program limitations: In the current version, a maximum of 511 basis "
"functions is allowed, and contracted functions cannot be used."
msgstr "程序限制：在当前版本中，最多允许 511 个基函数，并且不能使用收缩函数。"

