msgid ""
"External basis sets can be supplied in a file that must be located in the "
"working directory. Each record will contain the following data (free "
"format):"
msgstr "外部基组可以通过一个文件提供，该文件必须位于工作目录中。每条记录将包含以下数据（自由格式）："

msgid "I N L EXP NG"
msgstr "I N L EXP NG"

msgid "where:"
msgstr "其中："

msgid ""
"Atom type index is used to establish the correspondence between the basis "
"functions and the centers (atoms). All records having the same value of I "
"will define the basis set for all the atoms of the corresponding type."
msgstr "原子类型索引用于建立基函数与中心（原子）之间的对应关系。所有具有相同 I 值的记录将定义对应类型所有原子的基组。"

