" file like:"
msgstr "Clementi 和 Roetti 的单 Zeta 基组可以通过外部文件提供，例如："

msgid ""
"The first three records define the basis set for atoms of the first type "
"(carbon in this example), and the following three, the basis set for atoms "
"of the second type (oxygen)."
msgstr "前三条记录定义了第一种类型原子（本例中为碳）的基组，随后的三条记录定义了第二种类型原子（氧）的基组。"

msgid ""
"NG is mandatory even in case of diatomics, though gaussian expansions will "
"not be used, the value of NG being irrelevant in this case."
msgstr "即使在双原子分子的情况下，NG 也是必需的，尽管不会使用高斯展开，此时 NG 的值无关紧要。"

